WEBVTT

00:00:15.225 --> 00:00:22.256
I'll never be easily loved...

00:00:22.399 --> 00:00:29.465
Am I just too clumsy?

00:00:30.107 --> 00:00:36.672
That girl who looks good in pink...

00:00:37.314 --> 00:00:43.412
Is that who you want?

00:00:44.054 --> 00:00:48.048
Is red not good enough?

00:00:48.158 --> 00:00:55.087
The rabbit with red eyes runs away.

00:00:55.199 --> 00:01:02.469
Even though I loved you so much...

00:01:02.573 --> 00:01:10.573
If I'm sad, I'm going to die.

00:01:10.714 --> 00:01:17.086
The rabbit that you like...

00:01:17.855 --> 00:01:24.989
...isn't on the moon.
It's just a rabbit...

00:01:31.568 --> 00:01:34.731
Would you please
wait here for a little while?

00:01:38.108 --> 00:01:40.338
This will be my final indulgence.

00:01:40.444 --> 00:01:42.879
When I come back
after finishing him off...

00:01:44.214 --> 00:01:50.278
...please think of it as proof that
I'll assist you for the rest of my life.

00:01:51.155 --> 00:01:53.021
And when that fails to happen?

00:01:59.029 --> 00:02:00.019
Dream Play

00:02:01.498 --> 00:02:04.126
Your face is pale, like a girl's.

00:02:04.601 --> 00:02:09.471
Do you want people to point and
say you're rotten on the inside too?

00:02:09.573 --> 00:02:11.632
Well, Kagehisa?

00:02:11.742 --> 00:02:15.770
You had to have a mere child
save you. What a disgrace!

00:02:17.047 --> 00:02:18.572
Master, please stop!

00:02:18.682 --> 00:02:21.481
If she hadn't come, I would be dead!

00:02:22.086 --> 00:02:23.713
| owe her my life!

00:02:25.656 --> 00:02:32.119
The Itto-ryu head's grandson wasn't
even able to defeat a wild dog...

00:02:32.396 --> 00:02:35.127
...and you had to be saved by a girl.

00:02:35.232 --> 00:02:39.635
Your very life wouldn't be enough
to make up for such a scandal!

00:02:39.737 --> 00:02:41.330
You imbecile!

00:02:42.606 --> 00:02:46.133
Are you saying I have
to lose even more dignity?

00:02:52.483 --> 00:02:53.450
Master!

00:02:55.219 --> 00:02:56.653
Just watch.

00:02:57.121 --> 00:02:59.522
I'll erase your disgrace here and now.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:02.684
What disgrace? What dignity?

00:03:02.793 --> 00:03:05.660
Even killing women and children...

00:03:05.763 --> 00:03:10.325
If you have to stoop to killing either
to preserve it, what is dignity worth?

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:12.630
Your words ring true.

00:03:12.736 --> 00:03:15.228
If samurai weren't smitten with form...

00:03:15.339 --> 00:03:19.674
...I wouldn't have had to spend
half my life as an outcast.

00:03:20.177 --> 00:03:21.906
Right, Kagehisa?

00:03:24.882 --> 00:03:26.873
Tough luck for you.

00:03:33.023 --> 00:03:34.923
What's your name?

00:03:36.293 --> 00:03:39.228
Otonotachibana Makie.

00:03:39.863 --> 00:03:42.093
Your father's family name?

00:03:42.199 --> 00:03:44.099
Harukawa.

00:03:45.302 --> 00:03:47.896
Harukawa, you say?

00:03:50.307 --> 00:03:53.208
Master, why are
you doing such a thing?

00:03:54.244 --> 00:03:59.341
It's obvious wild dogs will be drawn
to the scent of blood and gather here.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:02.344
If she falls from the branch...

00:04:03.554 --> 00:04:04.453
Komae...

00:04:06.056 --> 00:04:07.490
Yoshiaki...

00:04:07.925 --> 00:04:10.087
That's right, isn't it?

00:04:10.761 --> 00:04:12.320
She's the one...

00:04:18.769 --> 00:04:21.795
What a happy little story.

00:04:21.905 --> 00:04:24.567
The fact that
she's alive in this world...

00:04:24.942 --> 00:04:29.880
...Is the ultimate shame
of the Harukawa household.

00:04:30.747 --> 00:04:35.685
You must've thought you
outmaneuvered me, eh, Yoshiaki?

00:04:56.573 --> 00:04:57.517
I trust in the Buddha of immeasurable light

00:04:57.541 --> 00:05:00.272
I trust in the Buddha of immeasurable light
Kuroi, what do you think of Grandfather?

00:05:01.612 --> 00:05:03.273
What do you mean?

00:05:03.347 --> 00:05:06.942
The old man's a loser.

00:05:08.552 --> 00:05:11.886
That's a reckless thing to say.

00:05:12.756 --> 00:05:15.782
He won't let go of shame and dignity.

00:05:16.226 --> 00:05:19.423
How is he different
from the Mutenichi-ryu...

00:05:19.529 --> 00:05:24.592
...who were too strict regarding
formality and style and expelled him?

00:05:24.701 --> 00:05:28.467
Shame, dignity, formality, style...

00:05:28.572 --> 00:05:31.371
Are such things virtues of ours?

00:05:31.675 --> 00:05:34.576
Never mind that people
actually die for them.

00:05:35.579 --> 00:05:40.312
Whether human or beast,
death is the duty of all creation.

00:05:40.984 --> 00:05:47.219
If death is enough to uphold dignity,
then even a monkey can be a samurai.

00:05:48.926 --> 00:05:51.088
What is it you're trying to say?

00:05:52.496 --> 00:05:56.126
| want to build a school
that laughs at their “virtues.”

00:05:56.667 --> 00:06:03.095
A powerful group that pursues
nothing but the sword and victory.

00:06:08.045 --> 00:06:10.480
Kuroi is dead too.

00:06:11.548 --> 00:06:15.712
The Itto-ryu's numbers are swelling,
but we lack strong swordsmen.

00:06:15.819 --> 00:06:17.981
Are we an enormous glass tiger?

00:06:19.022 --> 00:06:22.481
My childhood hero,
| want you at least...

00:06:23.460 --> 00:06:25.554
...not to betray me.

00:06:31.969 --> 00:06:33.095
Oh.

00:06:33.637 --> 00:06:35.628
What do you mean, "Oh”?

00:06:36.406 --> 00:06:38.431
Weren't you waiting for me?

00:06:38.775 --> 00:06:39.799
Maybe.

00:06:40.544 --> 00:06:44.037
Sorry about the other day...
for failing to deliver.

00:06:46.183 --> 00:06:48.277
So you'll satisfy me this time?

00:06:51.388 --> 00:06:55.325
Hey, Rin. I have some
business with this woman.

00:06:55.993 --> 00:06:59.896
Go treat yourself to mitsumame.

00:07:00.464 --> 00:07:01.625
She's thin...

00:07:01.732 --> 00:07:02.995
Pale...

00:07:03.333 --> 00:07:04.698
Beautiful...

00:07:05.035 --> 00:07:09.802
Yeah, compared to her,
I'm still just a kid.

00:07:10.140 --> 00:07:11.699
Right now, anyway.

00:07:11.808 --> 00:07:12.934
But...

00:07:13.043 --> 00:07:15.273
But just because...

00:07:15.579 --> 00:07:17.172
Why're you shaking?

00:07:20.650 --> 00:07:21.594
This enough?

00:07:21.618 --> 00:07:23.552
This enough?
Yeah, just enough.

00:07:25.589 --> 00:07:26.886
Bye then.

00:07:29.559 --> 00:07:30.924
What's with that?

00:07:31.161 --> 00:07:32.959
What a good girl.

00:07:33.730 --> 00:07:37.792
She doesn't need any praise
from anybody in the Itto-ryu.

00:07:37.901 --> 00:07:42.429
After all, she's trying to kill off
that Anotsu Kagehisa guy.

00:07:43.373 --> 00:07:45.034
For what reason?

00:07:46.510 --> 00:07:47.534
Revenge.

00:07:49.413 --> 00:07:50.403
Revenge?

00:07:51.348 --> 00:07:53.316
To avenge her parents.

00:07:58.088 --> 00:08:02.025
You are a little different
from the other day.

00:08:03.894 --> 00:08:05.191
The hair?

00:08:06.063 --> 00:08:07.030
No.

00:08:08.165 --> 00:08:09.132
Your eyes.

00:08:15.172 --> 00:08:18.142
Sweet Shop

00:08:21.445 --> 00:08:22.571
Hyakurin...

00:08:24.448 --> 00:08:25.472
One more.

00:09:08.258 --> 00:09:12.695
That was the best chance to finish
me off. Is she screwing with me?

00:09:14.164 --> 00:09:17.190
Huh. So your companion's
getting with a streetwalker.

00:09:17.300 --> 00:09:18.859
Who are you?

00:09:18.969 --> 00:09:23.202
Well, we're not
anyone in particular, uh...

00:09:23.540 --> 00:09:25.201
It's just, you know...

00:09:25.308 --> 00:09:26.776
Yeah, you know...

00:09:28.411 --> 00:09:30.675
That's a strange story though.

00:09:32.983 --> 00:09:34.473
Around here...

00:09:34.584 --> 00:09:39.283
...there's not one place where
streetwalkers could pick up clients.

00:09:40.290 --> 00:09:43.817
Where could they get it on
this early in the morning?

00:09:43.927 --> 00:09:46.419
But all they really need is a mat.

00:09:47.597 --> 00:09:50.225
She didn't have anything like that.

00:09:52.602 --> 00:09:53.660
No way...

00:10:36.313 --> 00:10:38.077
Something doesn't feel right.

00:10:38.181 --> 00:10:39.774
It's probably heartburn.

00:10:47.290 --> 00:10:50.157
She's doing the same
thing she did the other day...

00:10:50.260 --> 00:10:53.025
...but what's up
with her ridiculous speed?

00:10:53.997 --> 00:10:56.557
| can't believe I was lecturing her.

00:10:57.634 --> 00:11:01.867
| thought her slender arms and that
long-ass weapon were a bad combo...

00:11:01.972 --> 00:11:03.770
Man, was I wrong.

00:11:04.674 --> 00:11:07.769
| guess she needs
the weapon's centrifugal force...

00:11:07.877 --> 00:11:11.336
...to get that much destructive
power with her slim arms.

00:11:13.083 --> 00:11:16.883
Still though.
Look how easy she controls it.

00:11:17.354 --> 00:11:19.482
She's got serious skills.

00:11:20.824 --> 00:11:23.316
She might be the one who...

00:11:24.561 --> 00:11:28.122
| feel kinda bad since this is
pretty much a sneak attack...

00:11:28.231 --> 00:11:30.666
...but this'll make us even!

00:11:35.905 --> 00:11:38.101
Where could she be hiding?

00:11:50.253 --> 00:11:51.277
Infinity.

00:11:52.589 --> 00:11:53.283
Infinity.

00:12:12.942 --> 00:12:17.402
I-I'm sorry for doing
so many unfair things.

00:12:20.650 --> 00:12:22.641
Hey, don't hold back.

00:12:23.353 --> 00:12:27.312
I mean, as you can see,
| don't die too easily...

00:12:27.724 --> 00:12:30.216
...if you don't think outside the box.

00:12:30.860 --> 00:12:34.888
There's one way
| could be immobilized forever.

00:12:38.301 --> 00:12:40.395
Slice my head off...

00:12:42.172 --> 00:12:43.230
What?

00:12:43.340 --> 00:12:45.570
What are you so scared of?

00:12:45.675 --> 00:12:48.440
Is that all it takes to frighten you?

00:12:49.879 --> 00:12:52.371
It should be easy for you...

00:12:53.216 --> 00:12:55.184
...the way you were fighting.

00:13:00.790 --> 00:13:04.954
I killed three men before I saw you.

00:13:07.697 --> 00:13:08.926
Look...

00:13:09.032 --> 00:13:10.625
It won't stop.

00:13:10.900 --> 00:13:13.062
It happened then, and again now...

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:14.794
Why...

00:13:15.305 --> 00:13:19.799
Why do you continue
to do such cruel things?

00:13:21.077 --> 00:13:26.243
| forget while I'm fighting, but if I let
my mind wander for a second...

00:13:26.816 --> 00:13:29.513
...get so scared of what I've done.

00:13:32.322 --> 00:13:34.757
| suffer this awful feeling.

00:13:34.924 --> 00:13:40.226
| start to question
if his ideals are truly right...

00:13:41.197 --> 00:13:43.689
...and become
unable to hold a sword.

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:49.239
For what kind of ideal
is it right to kill people?

00:13:50.106 --> 00:13:52.803
Imagine if he dies before you.

00:13:53.443 --> 00:13:57.437
The only title you
earn then is murderer.

00:14:00.183 --> 00:14:02.675
No matter how much
talent you have...

00:14:02.786 --> 00:14:06.950
...no untrained woman
could ever move like that.

00:14:08.024 --> 00:14:12.291
There must've been some reason
you couldn't abandon the sword.

00:14:13.096 --> 00:14:16.532
Remember what
it was and fight for it!

00:14:20.170 --> 00:14:25.131
If you don't want to do that,
you'd be better off back at the brothel.

00:14:28.578 --> 00:14:32.412
You're still going to fight
with your body in that shape?

00:14:33.316 --> 00:14:37.947
I've never lost a single sword fight.

00:14:38.688 --> 00:14:40.952
That's actually a joke...

00:14:41.758 --> 00:14:46.320
...but I won't just sit here while someone
refuses to go all-out and finish this.

00:14:46.429 --> 00:14:50.696
I'd like to show off and say
I'll start fighting seriously now...

00:14:51.768 --> 00:14:54.794
...but unfortunately,
I've been serious the whole fight.

00:14:54.904 --> 00:14:59.637
So if nothing else, I'm gonna make
sure I don't have any regrets about it.

00:15:07.750 --> 00:15:10.845
Your words put my
mind a bit more at ease.

00:15:12.055 --> 00:15:13.716
I'll join you.

00:15:14.624 --> 00:15:16.592
What a good woman.

00:15:20.129 --> 00:15:21.893
That stupid show-off!

00:15:39.749 --> 00:15:42.377
Okay, now I'm ready.

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:45.347
Don't you get it?

00:15:45.455 --> 00:15:47.617
Let me spell it out.

00:15:48.858 --> 00:15:54.058
I'm seven weapons and one arm
lighter than I was before.

00:15:54.831 --> 00:15:57.857
Now I can keep up
with your moves...

00:15:57.967 --> 00:15:59.298
...think.

00:15:59.903 --> 00:16:04.431
If this takes much longer,
that idiot's gonna come back.

00:16:05.375 --> 00:16:08.538
So let's settle this with the next move.

00:16:08.978 --> 00:16:12.437
Agreed. Each for
their own reason for fighting.

00:16:13.149 --> 00:16:15.743
Yeah, that's the spirit.

00:16:18.021 --> 00:16:19.648
Prepare yourself.

00:16:31.200 --> 00:16:32.190
There!

00:16:32.735 --> 00:16:35.932
Can you do this
without a place to kick off?

00:16:43.379 --> 00:16:44.346
Shi...

00:17:04.901 --> 00:17:07.996
How about it, lady? Still scared?

00:17:09.839 --> 00:17:15.539
If you're okay
then finish me off this time...

00:17:16.713 --> 00:17:20.172
I've had about
all the shame I can take...

00:17:34.397 --> 00:17:37.992
You idiot, what are you
doing drawing that sword?

00:17:41.838 --> 00:17:43.738
Rin, right?

00:17:45.775 --> 00:17:48.972
| want to ask you one thing.

00:17:50.179 --> 00:17:54.980
How many people have
died for your revenge?

00:17:58.688 --> 00:18:01.851
How many people
in all will be dead...

00:18:02.725 --> 00:18:05.353
...by the time
you reach Anotsu Kagehisa?

00:18:06.663 --> 00:18:10.964
Have you ever thought about
whether it's right to kill people...

00:18:11.067 --> 00:18:15.470
...over a personal grudge
rather than a just cause?

00:18:18.174 --> 00:18:22.270
I swore in front
of my parents' graves...

00:18:22.712 --> 00:18:25.477
...to get revenge no matter what.

00:18:26.382 --> 00:18:31.718
That I'd do anything
to that end, however dirty...

00:18:33.656 --> 00:18:34.782
I don't...

00:18:35.591 --> 00:18:38.583
I don't believe
that killing people is right.

00:18:39.128 --> 00:18:44.362
But I'm not skilled enough
to live on without hurting others.

00:18:45.635 --> 00:18:50.903
It's a lot more human to get your
hands bloody over your family...

00:18:51.007 --> 00:18:55.171
...than to commit brutal acts
in the name of a just cause.

00:18:56.713 --> 00:19:00.308
Am I making a mistake?

00:19:08.057 --> 00:19:09.183
Thank you.

00:19:11.894 --> 00:19:13.828
That's what I wanted to hear.

00:19:19.035 --> 00:19:21.333
Please go on protecting her.

00:19:22.939 --> 00:19:25.567
And humiliate
myself again, you mean...

00:19:41.357 --> 00:19:42.449
Miss Ohatsu...

00:19:43.126 --> 00:19:46.926
| wanted to say my farewell to you.

00:19:48.965 --> 00:19:52.424
I'm going back to
the red-light district again.

00:19:53.436 --> 00:19:58.169
My stupid parents lost it all gambling
since they don't know when to stop.

00:19:58.674 --> 00:20:00.438
It's all too commonplace.

00:20:01.344 --> 00:20:05.781
I'm just a bird in a cage,
no matter where I go.

00:20:06.582 --> 00:20:11.076
I'd at least like for you
to get to walk in the light.

00:20:12.188 --> 00:20:16.125
When my mother was still alive,
she was a prostitute too.

00:20:18.027 --> 00:20:21.930
We were kicked out of a
samurai's household because of me...

00:20:22.031 --> 00:20:26.593
...and raising me alone, I guess
she didn't have much of a choice.

00:20:27.003 --> 00:20:30.371
Even then,
she didn't detest my father.

00:20:30.673 --> 00:20:34.132
She even rebuked me
for wanting to take up the sword...

00:20:34.243 --> 00:20:36.905
...and get revenge against him.

00:20:37.013 --> 00:20:41.348
| was always irritated
by how she lived her life.

00:20:42.485 --> 00:20:47.116
But compared to a swordsman
who lives his life hurting people...

00:20:47.223 --> 00:20:52.093
...how much more wonderful must it
be to live your life comforting others?

00:20:53.663 --> 00:20:57.031
I truly am proud of her now.

00:20:59.468 --> 00:21:02.267
| can no longer turn back.

00:21:02.705 --> 00:21:08.041
Because I've remembered I became
a swordswoman to kill my father.

00:21:09.512 --> 00:21:14.143
But I want to see
you live your life with pride.

00:21:15.585 --> 00:21:18.919
| will never forget all you did for me.

00:21:19.021 --> 00:21:20.546
Please take care.

00:21:22.725 --> 00:21:25.092
Right, and you too.

00:21:26.996 --> 00:21:29.192
It's totally ridiculous.

00:21:29.565 --> 00:21:33.195
| lost to a woman,
and I was saved by a woman.

00:21:33.669 --> 00:21:35.068
Yeah, seriously.

00:21:36.505 --> 00:21:40.567
You always brag
that you're immortal, Manji...

00:21:41.844 --> 00:21:46.145
...but you end up needing
me when it comes down to it.

00:21:47.783 --> 00:21:49.808
If you've learned your lesson...

00:21:49.919 --> 00:21:54.356
...don't ever lie to me
again like you did today.

00:22:03.933 --> 00:22:07.597
Excuse me. I thought
you might be my companion.

00:22:07.703 --> 00:22:11.037
Um, your companion
wanted you to have this...

00:22:15.678 --> 00:22:23.678
How do the forlorn go on living?

00:22:23.819 --> 00:22:28.484
That's what the world calls dreams.

00:22:28.658 --> 00:22:36.395
The world hates mankind endlessly...

00:22:36.499 --> 00:22:40.834
...and calls it love.

00:22:41.504 --> 00:22:49.070
They call it love.

00:22:55.785 --> 00:23:01.690
Sadly, I awakened...

00:23:01.791 --> 00:23:09.630
Overflowing reality is just...

00:23:10.566 --> 00:23:15.629
...more of the empty lies.

00:23:19.675 --> 00:23:27.675
To be honest, I have
to get ready for the next one.

00:23:29.352 --> 00:23:35.416
The morning slides
in from the window.

00:23:35.725 --> 00:23:42.995
Regardless of what
I see, I remember.

00:23:43.099 --> 00:23:46.364
| remember...

00:23:46.469 --> 00:23:52.841
The unchanging wind always...

00:23:52.942 --> 00:23:59.245
...just said this as it passed by...

00:23:59.382 --> 00:24:07.382
"What's needed for
this endless journey?”

00:24:20.169 --> 00:24:23.036
Where should I go?

00:24:25.274 --> 00:24:26.639
Infinite Preview

00:24:38.220 --> 00:24:39.619
Mask of Change
